abstract: >
  A compiler platform that lowers declarative biological intent through
  typed Genetic IR, CISC, RISC and Sequence IR, executes reduced-order
  digital twins, and keeps desired, predicted, observed and validated
  artifacts distinct. v1.0 is the publishable research-platform freeze.
keywords:
  - compiler
  - intermediate representation
  - developmental biology
  - digital twin
  - phenotype constraints
  - sequence IR
